# "If that mana is spent to cast <spell>, <says>"; "that spell <says>" (`mode`): an additional
# effect on the spell the mana is spent on [CR#106.6]. A restriction on what the mana can be spent
# on is `spendOnly`.
# TODO(spelling): The mode chooses cast, activation, or resolution wording.
primitive whenSpentOn(mode: SpentMode, spell: NounPhrase, says: Action): ManaRider = OnSpent
